 pre:{title:'UIUC ECE444 · Predeposition Equations',url:'https://fabweb.ece.illinois.edu/gt/equations/predep.aspx',note:'定表面濃度邊界條件、erfc 分布與劑量。'},
 drive:{title:'UIUC ECE444 · Drive Diffusion Equations',url:'https://fabweb.ece.illinois.edu/gt/equations/drive.aspx',note:'薄層初始分布的 Gaussian 近似及其適用限制。'},
 table:{title:'UIUC ECE444 · Silicon Diffusivity Data',url:'https://fabweb.ece.illinois.edu/gt/gt/gt10.aspx',note:'擴散係數、固溶度、材料與濃度依賴；參數不可跨條件直接套用。'},
