 ted:{title:'TU Wien · Puchner §4.3.3 Transient Enhanced Diffusion',url:'https://www.iue.tuwien.ac.at/phd/puchner/node32_app.html',note:'植入損傷、點缺陷過飽和與暫態增強擴散。'},
 oed:{title:'TU Wien · Oxidation Enhanced/Retarded Diffusion',url:'https://iue.tuwien.ac.at/phd/wimmer/node37.html',note:'氧化改變點缺陷族群；擴散加速或減緩取決於機制。'},
