 active:{title:'TU Wien · Transient Dopant Activation: Model Verification',url:'https://www.iue.tuwien.ac.at/phd/puchner/node37_app.html',note:'總化學濃度與 SIMS、活化濃度與 SRP 的區分。'},
 walk:{title:'MIT 18.366 · Random Walks and Diffusion, Lecture 1',url:'https://ocw.mit.edu/courses/18-366-random-walks-and-diffusion-fall-2006/521d5db639ed6c8761c96fa6d1627fca_lec01.pdf',note:'獨立等向步伐、連續極限、Gaussian 核與擴散尺度。'},
